The launcher for a release whose runner is the standalone build (standalone/, no Dolphin core):
MODERNGEKKO_STANDALONE_RUNNER hides the graphics backend row (Aurora picks the graphics API itself) and
lets Import a save take the standalone's own states ("SKST", one zstd frame) as well as Dolphin's.
Applies after dev's moderngekko-local, moderngekko-macos and moderngekko-launcher-signal patches.

